# Maintainer: Toemmsen96 <147745097+Toemmsen96@users.noreply.github.com>
# Mainline kernel for the Xiaomi 12 (cupid): Linux 7.3 stable from kernel.org.
#
# The sm8450-mainline fork (stable/next packages) is not needed any more for
# most of the SoC: 7.3 has the DPU quad-pipe work, the DSI byte clock rounding,
# the IPA v5.x GSI fixes and the CSID/VFE 680 blocks CAMSS builds on. What
# only the fork had is carried here as patches (fork-*): the generated panel
# driver for l3-42-02-0a, the ST FTS SPI touch driver from downstream, and
# two small sm8450.dtsi changes. The cupid devicetree is the next package's,
# adapted to mainline's sm8450.dtsi (flattened USB node, three reserved
# regions mainline no longer has).
#
# Our patches keep the numbers of the 6.13/6.17 packages. Dropped because 7.3
# has them or no longer needs them: 0009 (libbpf const, fixed upstream), 0015
# (DSI rounding), 0016 (GSI fixes). 0004 (PCIe link-training retry) is left
# out on purpose: the qcom PCIe driver and pwrctrl were reworked upstream;
# re-port it only if WiFi does not come up.
#
# First boot 2026-11-16: display (no more sporadic corruption), touch,
# battery, WiFi (r2, needs 0027), Bluetooth, modem, IPA, audio card and the
# camera stack work. 0028 adds the OV32B40 front camera (driver from the
# Xiaomi 14 Ultra port in dianqk/nixos-android-devices), streaming since r3.
# 0029 adds a driver for the S5K5E9 telemacro, written from the stock CamX
# module tables (r4). 0030 backports the CAMSS C-PHY series (David
# Heidelberg, v9), 0031 adds the SM8450 C-PHY sequence from the downstream
# camera driver, 0032 a driver for the IMX766 main camera (r5).
# 0033-0036: speakers. Legacy AudioReach TDM endpoint (Tatsuki Tanaka, via
# dianqk's marble port), 96 kHz TDM, CS35L41 slots through the channel map
# and a Xiaomi 12 card with the stock TDM backend and LPASS votes (r6).
# r13: 0019 reworked (AW8697 haptics init off the probe path, stops at the
# first I2C error) and the haptics node enabled again.
# r14: 0039 guards the WCD938x SoundWire interrupt callback against the RX
# device, which has no regmap (oopsed in the IRQ thread when a call started).
# r15: CONFIG_QCOMTEE=m (QTEE smcinvoke driver, first step towards running the
# stock fingerprint trusted app, see docs/08-fingerprint.md).
# r16: 0036 sets the CS35L41 frame sync inverted (NB_IF): the LPASS TDM
# frame sync arrives inverted, with NB_NF every sample came out as a
# full-level square of its sign.
# r17: 0040 raw APM commands through debugfs (q6apm_raw), for the voice call
# graph bring-up (docs/09-call-audio.md).
# r18: remote heap for the ADSP's static audio PD (fastrpc memory-region),
# which loads the voice ECNS module (hexagonrpcd -a).
# r20: 0041 q6apm_raw_shm, shared memory for raw APM commands: full-size
# VCPM calibration tables (over 4 KiB; the ADSP takes in-band packets only
# up to 4 KiB, which r19's waiting GPR send could not change).
# Keep stable/next as fallbacks: pmbootstrap config kernel next
_flavor="postmarketos-qcom-sm8450-cupid-mainline"
pkgname=linux-$_flavor
pkgver=7.3.4
pkgrel=20
pkgdesc="Linux 7.3 for the Xiaomi 12 (cupid) with the cupid patches (experimental)"
arch="aarch64"
_carch="arm64"
url="https://kernel.org"
license="GPL-2.0-only"
options="!strip !check !tracedeps
	pmb:cross-native
	pmb:kconfigcheck-nftables
	"
makedepends="
